ins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":986056,\"title\":\"Thunderbolts*\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hqcexYHbiTBfDIdDWxrxPtVndBX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rthMuZfFv4fqEU4JVbgSW9wQ8rs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After finding themselves ensnared in a death trap, seven disillusioned castoffs must embark on a dangerous mission that will force them to confront the darkest corners of their pasts.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21325,\"title\":\"Onmyoji\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ptiwNaV092Ut3qWLnN07fx2hFjl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/if0IBbnzdeacoGf2Dgj1dAqZktu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a dark time in the Heian period, when evil forces threaten the kingdom, the emperor relies on the onmyōji to keep the supernatural forces in line. But as political events become highly charged, friction within the order leads to betrayal. Now, Seimei, a talented member of the clan, must face down his master, Dōson, in the hopes of restoring peace to the kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40720,\"title\":\"Twelve\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cGcoACE6AQQWekvHMr4TVd5KOpH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fJJRx2J27xpMeeGoXlQbYuJoMiF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young drug dealer watches as his high-rolling life is dismantled in the wake of his cousin's murder, which sees his best friend arrested for the crime.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama